            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:06:31 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Stop the fan floor from believing its own writes</li><li>Stop handing the fans back to find out what macOS wants</li><li>Record why the fan floor uses the coarse thermal signal</li><li>Give the launcher a shadow it can actually cast</li><li>Round the launcher with squircles and line its edge</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/statico/macotron/releases/download/v0.3.5/Macotron-0.3.5.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ilbF9qfpMgUJL1LcMVm8kbokJYjp5xac8piM1hTVptj6aBCTv9z0Z7M8d3gG7cTpuXbgyxMZNOkhOPMaMa5ACg==" length="9210181" />
