            <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 02:47:46 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Attribute Claude Code in commit messages</li><li>Focus the launcher search field on the launch-time show</li><li>Announce new plugins and say "Load", not "Reload"</li><li>Tell plugin agents to log, and how to read the log</li><li>Make hid.readInput wait on the interrupt pipe</li><li>Queue unread HID input reports so a reply cannot outrun the read</li><li>Document the new hid.readInput in macotron.d.ts</li><li>Make the settings window taller by default</li></ul>]]></description>
